#!/usr/bin/env ruby
# frozen_string_literal: true
# ==============================================================================
# Unified LaTeX Builder (l)
#
# Robust, high-performance LaTeX compilation manager with:
# - Automatic main file detection (.mainfile or directory scan)
# - Isolated junk directory output (`junk/`)
# - Multi-engine support (xelatex [default], lualatex; pdflatex rejected)
# - BibTeX and Biber bibliography generation
# - Single-pass compilation mode (-u)
# - PDF text diff-based update mode (-d / --diff)
# - Detailed warning and error log analysis
# - Clean pre-builds and timing diagnostics
# ==============================================================================

